<title>USA: Funco Q2 same-store sales up 34 pct.</title>
<headline>Funco Q2 same-store sales up 34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Funco Inc said Monday comparable-store sales for the company's second quarter ended September 29 increased 34 percent from the same year-ago period.</p>
<p>It attributed the sales increase primarily to strong demand from for Sony Playstation and Sega Saturn products.</p>
<p>At September 29, Funco operated 176 stores in 42 markets, compared to 178 stores at October 1, 1995.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
